# H2O2: relaxed 1D scan of the dihedral H-O-O-H 0..180 (7 points); B3LYP/def2-SVP — the same path as one row of the 2D scan
! B3LYP def2-SVP TightSCF Opt
%geom Scan
  D 2 0 1 3 = 0.0, 180.0, 7
  end
end
* xyz 0 1
O   0.000000   0.734000  -0.054000
O   0.000000  -0.734000  -0.054000
H   0.839000   0.880000   0.422000
H  -0.839000  -0.880000   0.422000
*
